ss=\"elementor-price-list\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"elementor-price-list-item\">\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-price-list-text\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-price-list-header\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-price-list-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1) Posjeti internacionalnu stranicu BEST-a\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-price-list-separator\"><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-price-list-description\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNa stranici https:\/\/best.eu.org\/index.jsp kreiraj korisni\u010dki ra\u010dun koji \u0107e ti biti potreban za prijavu na seminare.\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/li>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"elementor-price-list-item\">\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-price-list-text\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-price-list-header\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-price-list-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t2) Istra\u017ei ponu\u0111ene seminare\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-price-list-separator\"><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-price-list-description\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNa stranici https:\/\/best.eu.org\/courses\/list.jsp mo\u017ee\u0161 prona\u0107i popis svih seminara na koje se mo\u017ee\u0161 trenutno prijaviti.\n<br>\nUkoliko je zavr\u0161ila jedna od 4 godi\u0161nje sezone seminara i nema otvorenih prijava, morati \u0107e\u0161 pri\u010dekati do sljede\u0107e sezone. Prati na\u0161u Facebook i Instagram stranicu na kojima redovito objavljujemo novosti kada se otvaraju idu\u0107e prijave!\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/li>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"elementor-price-list-item\">\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-price-list-text\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-price-list-header\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-price-list-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t3) Odaberi lokaciju\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-price-list-separator\"><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-price-list-description\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNajzabavniji dio (osim samog seminara naravno ;P) jest odabir teme i destinacije.\nMo\u017ee\u0161 prijaviti do tri seminara po sezoni i nakon \u0161to se odlu\u010di\u0161 pritisni Apply!\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/li>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"elementor-price-list-item\">\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-price-list-text\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-price-list-header\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-price-list-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t4) Napi\u0161i motivacijsko pismo\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-price-list-separator\"><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-price-list-description\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tKratko i neformalno \u2013 \u010ditat \u0107e ga tvoji kolege studenti, poku\u0161aj se istaknuti i nasmijati ih!\n<br>\nTajna uspje\u0161ne prijave le\u017ei u sudjelovanju na Radionici pisanja motivacijskih pisama koju odr\u017eavamo barem jednom za vrijeme prijava. Savjete za pisanje motivacijskog pisma mo\u017ee\u0161 prona\u0107i i na: Kako napisati motivacijsko pismo, ali savjetujemo da nam se pridru\u017ei\u0161 na radionici kako bi vidio primjere dobrih pisama i \u010duo savjete osoba koje su zahvaljuju\u0107i svojim pismima primljene na seminare.\n<br>\nPosjeti na\u0161u Facebook stranicu na kojoj redovito objavljujemo kada organiziramo radionice motivacijskih pisama!\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/li>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"elementor-price-list-item\">\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-